{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And all the men of his household.</b> The verse above refers to Abraham's men, and this one refers to all the men of his household — those born in his household and acquired with money — who were Ishmael's." "<b>They were circumcised with him.</b> It does not write 'they circumcised him' here, but rather <b>נמלו</b> — of their own will, for he did not force them. <b>End of parashat Lech Lecha.</b>"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:32.217261865Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}